---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { org } from '../data/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description={`How ${org.name} collects, uses and protects the personal information of donors, volunteers and website visitors.`}
  updated="7 September 2026"
>
  <p>
    {org.name} ("we", "us") respects your privacy. This policy explains what personal information we
    collect through this website, why we collect it, and the choices you have.
  </p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Details you submit through our contact form: name, email address, phone number and message.</li>
    <li>Donation details you share with us, including transaction reference numbers, so we can issue receipts.</li>
    <li>Basic technical information your browser sends, such as device type and pages visited.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use your information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To reply to your enquiry.</li>
    <li>To issue donation receipts and tax exemption certificates.</li>
    <li>To send occasional updates on the projects your contribution supported, where you have asked for them.</li>
    <li>To meet our statutory record-keeping and reporting obligations.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What we do not do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>We do not sell, rent or trade your personal information.</li>
    <li>We do not share donor details with third parties except where required by law or by our auditors and bankers.</li>
    <li>We do not collect card or net banking credentials on this website.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Data retention</h2>
  <p>
    Donation records are retained for the period required under Indian tax and CSR reporting rules.
    Contact form enquiries are retained only for as long as needed to resolve them.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You may ask us to confirm what personal information we hold about you, correct it, or delete it
    where we are not legally required to keep it. Write to <a href={org.emailHref}>{org.email}</a> and
    we will respond within 30 days.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
  <p>
    This website does not set advertising or tracking cookies. If analytics are added in future, this
    policy will be updated before they go live.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party services</h2>
  <p>
    Our contact form and embedded map are provided by third parties who process your submission on our
    behalf. Our payment collection is handled by our bank. Each operates under its own privacy policy.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top of this page always reflects the
    current version.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
